"Ini adalah breakdown kasar mesin referrer dari entrance organik lokal. "
"Analitik kueri dan profil pengguna tetap di luar tampilan lokal ini."

#: src/Admin/AdminController.php:1006
msgid ""
"This local operational audit reports local readiness evidence. The "
"downloadable JSON contains bounded diagnostics while sensitive API keys, "
"content bodies, email addresses, raw SEO values and database credentials stay"
" out of the export."
msgstr ""
"Audit operasional lokal ini melaporkan bukti kesiapan lokal. JSON yang dapat "
"diunduh berisi diagnostik berbatas sementara kunci API sensitif, body konten,"
" alamat email, nilai SEO mentah, dan kredensial database tetap di luar "
"ekspor."

#: src/Admin/AdminController.php:891
msgid ""
"This is intentionally separate from takeover evidence. It copies exact Yoast "
"values only into empty YSEO shadow fields in bounded batches, preserves "
"existing YSEO edits and Yoast source data, and keeps public authority "
"unchanged. Use it to compare both editors long before takeover."
msgstr ""
"Ini sengaja terpisah dari bukti takeover. Ia hanya menyalin nilai Yoast "
"persis ke field shadow YSEO kosong dalam batch berbatas, mempertahankan edit "
"YSEO yang ada dan data sumber Yoast, serta menjaga otoritas publik tetap "
"tidak berubah. Gunakan untuk membandingkan kedua editor jauh sebelum "
"takeover."

#: src/Analysis/ReadabilityAnalyzer.php:138
