"normal HTML URL remains canonical."
msgstr ""
"YSEO dapat menerbitkan root /llms.txt plus file /section/llms.txt scoped "
"opsional. Setiap sumber daya yang memenuhi syarat mempertahankan alternatif "
".md bersih sendiri, sementara URL HTML normal tetap kanonis."

#: src/Admin/SeoEditorController.php:616
msgid ""
"External CDN/WAF policy remains an edge-layer source of truth. If this site "
"uses Cloudflare and you want Search allowed while Training is refused, verify"
" Cloudflare uses Disallow AI Training instead of Training=Block or Block on "
"pages with ads."
msgstr ""
"Kebijakan CDN/WAF eksternal tetap menjadi sumber kebenaran lapisan edge. Jika"
" situs ini menggunakan Cloudflare dan Anda ingin Search diizinkan sementara "
"Training ditolak, verifikasi Cloudflare menggunakan Disallow AI Training "
"alih-alih Training=Block atau Block pada halaman dengan iklan."

