"YSEO emits verification meta tags only while it owns public SEO output. "
"Verification-tag rendering remains local."
msgstr ""
"YSEO memancarkan tag meta verifikasi hanya saat memegang output SEO publik. "
"Rendering tag verifikasi tetap lokal."

